  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MHPSS Madagascar &#x2013;MHPSS Officer with ACF</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Madagascar&#x2019;s MHPSS Technical Working Group was established following technical support provided between July and November 2025, with the aim of improving national coordination among actors working on mental health and psychosocial support. While the group has helped strengthen communication between partners and created a foundation for more structured MHPSS coordination, it remains in a consolidation phase and still requires targeted technical support.This need has become more urgent because Madagascar is facing several overlapping emergencies. The Mpox outbreak, declared in December 2025, has already required MHPSS coordination support, while the cyclones Fytia and G&#xe9;zani in early 2026 created additional humanitarian needs. Cyclone G&#xe9;zani in particular highlighted the importance of fully integrating MHPSS into emergency response efforts. In this context, short-term technical assistance is needed to strengthen the MHPSS TWG&#x2019;s coordination capacity, support the response to Cyclone G&#xe9;zani, follow up on Mpox-related support, improve links between national and subnational coordination mechanisms, and draw lessons to better prepare for future emergencies.</narrative>
  </description>
